<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rate drops to 4.86 percent.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rate drops to 4.86 percent.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar fell to 4.86 percent on Monday from 5.46 percent on Saturday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>It said three banks traded on the market when it opened after a public holiday on Sunday to mark Independence Day in 11 reported transactions with a total value of 14.2 million dinars ($20 million).</p>
<p>$1 = 0.708 dinar</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
